= Summary
<summary>
#dropcap[This is a template for a (PdD) thesis following the
TU Delft corporate design#footnote[https://www.tudelft.nl/en/tu-delft-corporate-design]
using Typst. It used the font family
Roboto Slab#footnote[https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto+Slab] and
Arial#footnote[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arial] or alternatively the
Typst default font
Libertinus Serif#footnote[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libertinus].]

The template is made by the same authors as the
TU Delft dissertation and report templates found on Overleaf#footnote[https://www.overleaf.com/edu/tudelft#templates].
The repository of the developers is https://gitlab.com/novanext
